OL,3,GNEWSAAncient supervolcano found under
OL,4,AEnglish coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists have discovered the remains
OL,7,Fof a massive volcano, thousands of
OL,8,Ftimes more powerful than Mount Etna,
OL,9,Fdeep beneath England's east coast.
OL,11,FThe supervolcano, centred under The
OL,12,FWash and extending into Norfolk and
OL,13,FLincolnshire, measured at least 65km
OL,14,F(40 miles) across and erupted with the
OL,15,Fforce of several thousand hydrogen
OL,16,Fbombs 454 million years ago.
OL,18,FExperts at the British Geological
OL,19,FSurvey (BGS) believe it explains a huge
OL,20,Flayer of volcanic ash spread across
OL,21,FNorway, Sweden, the Baltic region,
OL,22,FBelarus and Poland.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
